We had made the game generally looked cooler :). The upgrade version is fully launched, more faster then I imagined! Cheers!

1. Chinese and Japanese language packs added;

2. A new vivid beginners guide;

3. Optimized tail flame appearance of the enemy battleships, can now easily tell the deference of them. 

4. Optimized finish sign ;

5. Added effects to HP bar, made it more clear inside the cockpit.

